<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 200 mln one-year bonds May 21.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 200 mln one-year bonds May 21.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland offered 200 million zlotys of one-year floating bonds, due on June 4, 1998, at a primary tender on May 21, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The value date for the tender is June 3, 1997.</p>
<p>Full details available on  NBPV and more information on Polish treasuries on  PLMINFIN.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
